      today: { task: "Ask 3 people who don't know PMT: “What would you guess a 2-day motorcycle licensing course costs?” Write down their guesses before you tell them anything. Compare with the real price.", output: "3 anticipated prices vs. the marked price, plus one idea to widen the gap", minutes: 15 },
