          model: "1. Signal: 3 of PMT's last 20 inquiries came from women aged 40+ whose kids have grown up (DMs).\nWhy: more free time, wanting their own adventure, watching partners ride.\n3 years: a big under-served segment.\nBet: one ad set and one testimonial video featuring a 45+ woman student; $100 test.\n\n2. Signal: two roofing prospects said their office manager handles all marketing decisions.\nWhy: owners are on roofs all day.\n3 years: the office manager is the real buyer.\nBet: a one-page version of my pitch written for office managers."
